Date added :date {default=today()}
Start date* :separate_date
End date* :separate_date {min=get('start_date_year')}
Description* :text


-Add occupation	$add_occupation	:add_entry_link	{modal_name=occupation_modal,parent_key=buttons}

-:encounter_modal $occupation_modal
	
-Occupations :encounter_table $occupation_table {cols=date_added;start_date;end_date;description}